          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.046,
            0.236,
            0.421,
            0.288
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "An Attempt to Classify"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.067,
            0.338,
            0.777,
            0.424
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "\u0000 Two approaches : human-centered vs . rationality. B oth directions have yielded some valuable insights ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.443,
            0.757,
            0.529
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "– A human-centered approach is empirical science, involving hypothesis and experimental confirmation."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.548,
            0.826,
            0.636
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "– A rationalist approach involves a combination of mathematics and engineering."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.067,
            0.664,
            0.82,
            0.761
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "\u0000 B oth approaches can be broken up into fields that are concerned with – the thought process and reasoning, or"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.78,
            0.27,
            0.814
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "– the behavior."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.0,
            0.954,
            0.35,
            0.982
          ],
          "content": [
